caption: Embodiment of Yang
tradition-component: embodiment-of-yang

Cost: 100 points

Prerequisites: Occult Mastery (High Magic), Yang Master

Requirements: Magery 5, Thaumatology 30

You embody the concept of Yang. Your skin, eyes and hair become brighter colors, and you emit light visible to anyone with any points in any form of Magery. You may purchase any level of Attractive or Charisma. All of your magic is bright, loud, and ostentatious, not just High Magic. You lose all benefits of Yin Master and may never purchase that advantage or Embodiment of Yin. You may no longer cast using Yin. The damage and area of effect of all your high magic effects are doubled; this doubling occurs after all other multiplicative effects. You recover an amount of fatigue each second equal to one quarter your Magery, rounded down, minimum 1. From a lore perspective, whether someone can embody Yin or Yang is determined at birth, and is related to gender.
